   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RS! Ghana Gold</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to a responsible global gold value chain, where artisanal small-scale gold miners, the majority being women, work under legal and safe conditions, earning a living income with improved bargaining positions vis-a-vis buyers and investors, and where biodiversity is protected.- Objectives- Artisanal and Smallscale Miners -Women ASM- CS Organisations -Objectives New inclusive regulatory framework in Uganda that optimise inlusive formalisation, decent work and fair value distributionCSO network that is empowered to campaign ASGM are empowered to negotiate for better conditions</narrative>
  </description>
